  "_comment": "Deliberate departures of the web instrument from the WHO V2.0 workbook (policy: docs/policy/va-form-project-configuration.md, 'Deviations from the WHO reference'). One list: tooling/who-va-2022/build-instrument-from-xlsform.py applies it to the instrument JSON, app/services/xlsform_service.py applies the same entries to the ODK form. Entries use the instrument's own field shapes.",
