    "Id10365": "The source constraint rejects a valid normal birth-weight combination (no health card, Id10363 = No, Id10365 = No). Dropped; owner decision 2026-10-06, see docs/kb/WHO_VA_2022_Docs/id10365-birth-size-flow.md. Every other WHO check stays.",
    "Id10382": "Matches the interviewer guidance that 99 means don't know and a true 88-hour estimate is entered as 87; a clearer app-supplied message than the workbook's.",
