    "Id10023_b": "Clearer app-supplied English constraint message than the workbook's.",
    "nmh": "Shown under consented > injuries_accidents so the mid-form guidance appears with the injury section instead of as a detached completion-screen item. ODK: the row moves to the top of that group.",
